    {
      "q": "Which agencies award the most contracts in Minnesota?",
      "a": "The Department of Defense, Department of Veterans Affairs, and Department of Agriculture award the most contracts in Minnesota. The Department of Defense obligated $460M, the Department of Veterans Affairs obligated $246M, the Department of Agriculture obligated $244M, the General Services Administration obligated $141M, and the Department of Health and Human Services obligated $125M."
    },
